OL,3,GNEWSAAthletes run 100km to help revamp
OL,4,Astadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of young aspiring athletes will
OL,7,Ftake on a running challenge to raise
OL,8,Fmoney for a stadium with "rundown"
OL,9,Ffacilities.
OL,11,FNotts Athletics Club said its home,
OL,12,FHarvey Hadden Stadium in Bilborough,
OL,13,Fhad fallen into disrepair and was in
OL,14,Fneed of investment.
OL,16,FConcerned about the state of the
OL,17,Ffacilities, friends Lucy Sanderson and
OL,18,FSophia Weston, both 14, organised a
OL,19,Flong-distance relay, hoping to run at
OL,20,Fleast 62 miles (100km) collectively.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
